OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fpleasantly warm end to Friday with
OL,7,Fplenty of evening sunshine. Dry
OL,8,Fovernight with long clear periods and
OL,9,Fturning rather fresh with rural spots
OL,10,Fgetting quite chilly by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mainly sunny start and
OL,13,Fsoon warming up. Fair weather cloud
OL,14,Fdeveloping but plenty of sunny periods
OL,15,Finto the afternoon, though some wispy
OL,16,Fhigh cloud may build later. Light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
