OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLocally
OL,6,Fchilly first thing on Sunday, then
OL,7,Fplenty of warm hazy sunshine. More
OL,8,Fchangeable early next week with a
OL,9,Fchance of showers, perhaps heavy and
OL,10,Fthundery. Becoming very warm again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
